{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依都市計畫法第五十條第三項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070003/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"bab124f53c9f68e1cdbc5db1bf3fd12e26db5f538b95183346ec2e464a6815b2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":22,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"都市計畫公共設施保留地（以下簡稱公共設施保留地）除中央、直轄市、縣（市）政府擬有開闢計畫及經費預算，並經核定發布實施者外，土地所有權人得依本辦法自行或提供他人申請作臨時建築之使用。","id":"D0070003/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"7a172bd10120a50392e930e5ed757c10050c31745c12f8f1fe554018085a37bc","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":90,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法所稱臨時建築權利人係指土地所有權人、承租人或使用人依本辦法申請為臨時建築而有使用權利之人。","id":"D0070003/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"708c8e55dcfefa7b317ede7f668b44eba0de7f67e5e77b9453037f6cecfd4cad","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":48,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"公共設施保留地臨時建築不得妨礙既成巷路之通行，鄰近之土地使用分區及其他法令規定之禁止或限制建築事項，並以下列建築使用為限：\n一、臨時建築權利人之自用住宅。\n二、菇寮、花棚、養魚池及其他供農業使用之建築物。\n三、小型游泳池、運動設施及其他供社區遊憩使用之建築物。\n四、幼稚園、托兒所、簡易汽車駕駛訓練場。\n五、臨時攤販集中場。\n六、停車場、無線電基地臺及其他交通服務設施使用之建築物。\n七、其他依都市計畫法第五十一條規定得使用之建築物。\n前項建築使用細目、建蔽率及最大建築面積限制，由直轄市、縣（市）政府依當地情形及公共設施興闢計畫訂定之。","id":"D0070003/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"3eccc26e6ad5e113108b022ea52f3d43a2111cbe212d01ce69cf36249b4c821f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":218,"children":[{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":62,"end":78,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":78,"end":103,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":103,"end":131,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":131,"end":152,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":152,"end":163,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":163,"end":192,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":192,"end":218,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070003/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":218,"end":269,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"公共設施保留地臨時建築之構造以木構造、磚造、鋼構造及冷軋型鋼構造等之地面上一層建築物為限，簷高不得超過三點五公尺。但前條第一項第二款、第三款及第六款之臨時建築以木構造、鋼構造及冷軋型鋼構造建造，且經直轄市、縣（市）政府依當地都市計畫發展情形及建築結構安全核可者，其簷高得為十公尺以下。\n前條第一項第六款停車場之臨時建築以鋼構造或冷軋型鋼構造建造，經當地直轄市或縣（市）交通主管機關依其都市發展現況，鄰近地區停車需求、都市計畫、都市景觀、使用安全性及對環境影響等有關事項審查核可者，其樓層數不受前項之限制。","id":"D0070003/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"e7daf633f98ddb88c0f3793630f4205758ac241990876acbf267437260bfc143","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":143,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:5/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":143,"end":252,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"臨時建築之公共設施保留地，應與二公尺以上既成巷道相連接。其連接部份之最小寬度應在二公尺以上，未連接既成巷道者，應自設通路，其自設通路之寬度不得小於左列標準：\n一、長度在未滿十公尺者為二公尺。\n二、長度在十公尺以上未滿二十公尺者為三公尺。\n三、長度逾二十公尺者為五公尺。\n前項自設通路，應以都市計畫道路邊界為起點計算，其土地不得計入建築基地面積。","id":"D0070003/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"b4dbcb3649876d8d2562f8de9d05eba5887560b5c127bf3ce1c4e5a4e5aa3320","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":135,"children":[{"id":"D0070003/a:6/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":79,"end":96,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:6/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":96,"end":119,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070003/a:6/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":119,"end":135,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070003/a:6/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":135,"end":172,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"在公共設施道路及綠地保留地上，申請臨時建築者，限於計畫寬度在十五公尺寬以上，並應於其兩側各保留四公尺寬之通路。","id":"D0070003/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"2d49e0ec096f5c25a06ff9b861964b48f71643a1af013ddc463e41d4e24992df","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":55,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"公共設施保留地申請為臨時建築使用，應具備申請書，土地登記簿謄本或土地使用同意書或土地租賃契約，工程圖樣及說明書向直轄市、縣（市）主管建築機關申領臨時建築許可證後始得為之。","id":"D0070003/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"639779265b2214b75364068f0ad7fceae9444e3f74a425b62b8b5576e84bb532","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":85,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"公共設施保留地臨時建築之施工管理，應依建築法有關規定辦理。","id":"D0070003/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"ca8846523aacc0925843ad33a8675173dcfd8ee5746fad06c35c7eee2a8412cd","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":29,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"公共設施保留地臨時建築工程完竣後，應由起造人會同承造人申請臨時建築物使用許可證，並得憑以申請接水接電。","id":"D0070003/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"f6133842fc7c6417fc8648908dcc1024569a32ab49e02bc3e99eb5b16a25705d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"公共設施保留地臨時建築之權利人，應依都市計畫法第五十條第二項規定，於接獲地方政府開闢公共設施通知限期拆除時，負有自行無條件拆除之義務，逾期不拆者，由地方政府強制拆除之；其所需僱工拆除費用，由臨時建築權利人負擔。","id":"D0070003/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"39b736ae71edc8617321e810df1c5829785c1fb1deb6644eab2cece44902535d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":105,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0070003/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070003/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"都市計畫與土地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國六十三年十二月五日內政部（63）台內營字第 61233  號令訂\n  定發布\n2.中華民國六十五年七月八日內政部（65）台內營字第 686392 號令修正\n  發布\n3.中華民國七十三年十月十九日內政部（73）台內營字第 266054 號令修\n  正發布\n4.中華民國七十七年十月十二日內政部（77）台內營字第 632864 號令修\n  正發布\n5.中華民國八十八年六月二十九日內政部（88）台內營字第 8873677  號\n  令修正發布第 2、4 條條文\n6.中華民國九十二年八月十四日內政部台內營字第 0920088282 號令修正\n  發布第 5  條條文\n7.中華民國一百年十一月十六日內政部台內營字第 1000809398 號令修正\n  發布第 4、5 條條文","id":"D0070003","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2011-11-16","name":"都市計畫公共設施保留地臨時建築使用辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070003","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"1ac1a90853eefd79a73ef41171673b6e93937130d1c77f4652a58a88334f8ed2","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2011-11-16","effectiveDate":""}}